{"id":"decision-example-001","type":"decision","fact":"Example: Chose Zustand over Redux for client state management because of simpler API and smaller bundle size.","recommendation":"Use Zustand stores for client state. Use TanStack Query for server state. Do not mix the two patterns.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"human","reference":"Architecture decision","date":"2026-01-09"}],"tags":["architecture","state-management","zustand"],"affectedFiles":["src/stores/**/*.ts"],"affectedServices":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-09T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-09T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id": "decision-design-token-single-source-001", "type": "decision", "fact": "mobile/src/theme/tokens.raw.js is the single source of truth for the design system: it is plain CommonJS so both mobile/src/theme/tokens.ts (TypeScript consumers) and mobile/tailwind.config.js (build-time) can require it. The Tailwind config emits the 18 text-* utilities from a PLUGIN rather than theme.extend.fontSize, because a fontSize tuple can carry lineHeight/letterSpacing/fontWeight but NOT fontFamily — a plain fontSize entry could never attach a typeface. theme.extend.fontSize is left deliberately unset so a stray text-base cannot bypass the scale.", "recommendation": "Add or change colours, type styles and radii in tokens.raw.js only; never hardcode a hex, a px font size or a raw borderRadius in a screen or component. Do not add theme.extend.fontSize to tailwind.config.js — it would reintroduce off-scale utilities that carry no font family.", "confidence": "high", "provenance": [{"source": "agent", "reference": "specs/017-ui-refresh self-reflect", "date": "2026-11-06"}], "tags": ["design-system", "nativewind", "tailwind", "tokens", "architecture"], "affectedFiles": ["mobile/src/theme/tokens.raw.js", "mobile/src/theme/tokens.ts", "mobile/tailwind.config.js"], "affectedServices": [], "createdAt": "2026-11-06T00:00:00Z", "updatedAt": "2026-11-06T00:00:00Z", "usageCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0, "outdatedReports": 0}
{"id": "decision-brand-contrast-single-leg-001", "type": "decision", "fact": "resolveBrandTheme's WCAG AA gate for a tenant's accent colour checks ONE leg only — espresso text on the accent background. The original two-leg gate (also requiring white-on-accent to pass) is arithmetically unsatisfiable: espresso-on-accent at 4.5:1 requires the accent's relative luminance L >= 0.2403 while white-on-accent at 4.5:1 requires L <= 0.1717, so no colour could ever pass both and every tenant brand silently fell back to the default.", "recommendation": "Do not 'restore' the white-on-accent leg in mobile/src/theme/brand/resolveBrandTheme.ts — it is not an oversight. Any accent-pairing change must be re-derived against both luminance bounds before it is added.", "confidence": "high", "provenance": [{"source": "agent", "reference": "specs/017-ui-refresh self-reflect", "date": "2026-11-06"}], "tags": ["accessibility", "wcag", "theming", "multi-tenant", "brand"], "affectedFiles": ["mobile/src/theme/brand/resolveBrandTheme.ts", "mobile/src/theme/brand/contrastCheck.ts"], "affectedServices": [], "createdAt": "2026-11-06T00:00:00Z", "updatedAt": "2026-11-06T00:00:00Z", "usageCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0, "outdatedReports": 0}
{"id": "decision-drawer-identity-build-time-001", "type": "decision", "fact": "Side menus show the user's name and their canteen and never their role (specs/017-ui-refresh FR-027). The canteen label comes from Config.APP_DISPLAY_NAME via getTenantDisplayName() — build-time, exactly like COMPANY_ID — and is deliberately NOT fetched: the drawer currently issues no network request, and adding one to render a label would be a behavioural change. Role-based ROUTING in AppShell is unchanged; only the role DISPLAY was removed.", "recommendation": "Keep the drawer request-free. A branded build that does not set APP_DISPLAY_NAME simply omits the canteen line. Do not reintroduce a role label or a role chip in any side menu.", "confidence": "medium", "provenance": [{"source": "agent", "reference": "specs/017-ui-refresh self-reflect", "date": "2026-11-06"}], "tags": ["mobile", "navigation", "multi-tenant", "privacy"], "affectedFiles": ["mobile/src/navigation/AppShell.tsx", "mobile/src/config/tenant.ts"], "affectedServices": [], "createdAt": "2026-11-06T00:00:00Z", "updatedAt": "2026-11-06T00:00:00Z", "usageCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0, "outdatedReports": 0}
